<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[55vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/didtfhfme/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1783923968/const_xzxg5p.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30" alt="Construction Products"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">CPR â€” Regulation 305/2011</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">Construction Products <span class="text-eurogold-400">CE Certification</span></h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">CPR 305/2011 Compliance for European Market Access. Comprehensive CPR compliance and CE marking services for construction materials and components â€” ensuring seamless entry into European markets with full regulatory confidence.</p></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Standard Overview</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">CE Certification for <span class="text-euro-600">Construction Products</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">We provide end-to-end certification and compliance solutions aligned with <strong class="text-slate-700">Construction Products Regulation (CPR) 305/2011</strong>, helping organizations meet EU regulatory requirements and industry standards efficiently.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-info-circle text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">What is CPR?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">The <strong class="text-slate-700">Construction Products Regulation (CPR)</strong> ensures that reliable and standardized performance information is available to professionals, regulatory authorities, and end users and consumers. This helps demonstrate compliance while promoting safety, transparency, and best practices across the construction industry.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[320px] md:h-[400px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367978/eurocert/c2.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="Construction Products"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_left,rgba(212,168,67,0.05)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Regulation 305/2011 â€” Key Insights</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">CPR Framework &amp; Common Technical Language</h2></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-8"><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-building text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">What is a Construction Product?</h4></div><p class="text-white/55 text-sm leading-relaxed italic">Any product or combination of products manufactured and marketed for permanent incorporation in construction works, where its performance affects the overall performance of the structure.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-gavel text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Regulation 305/2011 â€” Key Insights</h4></div><p class="text-white/55 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">The CPR replaced Directive <strong class="text-white/70">89/106/EEC</strong> and established:</p><ul class="space-y-2 text-white/55 text-sm"><li>â€¢ Harmonized rules for <strong class="text-white/70">performance evaluation</strong></li><li>â€¢ Standardized framework for <strong class="text-white/70">CE marking</strong></li><li>â€¢ A unified <strong class="text-white/70">&quot;common technical language&quot;</strong> across Europe</li></ul><p class="text-white/55 text-sm leading-relaxed mt-3">This simplifies product compliance and improves consistency in construction quality.</p></div></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Common Technical Language â€” Who Uses It?</h4><div class="space-y-3"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-sm shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center">01</span><p class="text-white/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">Manufacturers â€” Declare product performance based on harmonized standards</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-sm shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center">02</span><p class="text-white/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">Member State Authorities â€” Define regulatory requirements and compliance criteria</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-sm shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center">03</span><p class="text-white/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">Users (Architects, Engineers, Builders) â€” Select suitable products based on intended application</p></div></div></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Objectives of CPR</h4><div class="space-y-3"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><p class="text-white/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">Clarify CE marking and regulatory concepts</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><p class="text-white/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">Simplify procedures, especially for SMEs</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><p class="text-white/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">Enhance reliability of performance data</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg><p class="text-white/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">Strengthen transparency in construction materials</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Compliance Framework</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">CE Marking &amp; Declaration of Performance</h2></div><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8"><div class="relative p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-gradient-to-br from-euro-50/60 to-white overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute -bottom-4 -right-4 w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-euro-600/3 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-euro-100 text-4xl"></i></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">CE Marking</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">CE marking allows products to be <strong class="text-slate-700">legally marketed across EU member states</strong>. It confirms compliance with declared performance, is based on harmonized technical specifications, and indicates manufacturer responsibility.</p><p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed p-3 bg-amber-50 rounded-lg border border-amber-100"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle text-amber-500 mr-1"></i><strong>Important:</strong> CE marking does not guarantee suitability for all applications â€” selection depends on project-specific requirements.</p></div><div class="relative p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-gradient-to-br from-euro-50/60 to-white overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute -bottom-4 -right-4 w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-euro-600/3 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none"><i class="fas fa-file-signature text-euro-100 text-4xl"></i></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-file-signature text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Declaration of Performance (DoP)</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">The <strong class="text-slate-700">Declaration of Performance (DoP)</strong> is a mandatory document when a product is covered under a harmonized standard or a European Technical Assessment (ETA) is issued.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2"><strong class="text-slate-700">Key Points:</strong></p><ul class="text-slate-500 text-sm space-y-1 mb-3"><li>â€¢ Defines essential characteristics of the product</li><li>â€¢ Includes performance values or classes</li><li>â€¢ Holds the manufacturer accountable</li></ul><p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed"><i class="fas fa-check text-euro-600 mr-1"></i> Authorities consider DoP reliable unless proven otherwise.</p></div></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4"><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-chart-bar text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Performance Information â€” How It&#x27;s Presented</h4></div><p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed mb-4">Understanding performance data is critical for decision-makers.</p><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4"><div class="text-center p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 transition-colors"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-500 font-bold text-xl block mb-1">01</span><h5 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Threshold</h5><p class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">Minimum performance requirement achieved</p></div><div class="text-center p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 transition-colors"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-500 font-bold text-xl block mb-1">02</span><h5 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Declared Value</h5><p class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">Measured performance value</p></div><div class="text-center p-4 bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 transition-colors"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-500 font-bold text-xl block mb-1">03</span><h5 class="heading-font text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Class of Service</h5><p class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">Performance category or classification</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Our Services</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Construction Products <span class="text-euro-600">Certification Services</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Certification &amp; Compliance</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Complete CPR verification and CE marking support.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Audit &amp; Assessment</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">On-site inspections and technical file evaluation.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-chalkboard-teacher text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Training &amp; Consultancy</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Expert guidance on CPR documentation and compliance.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-headset text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Ongoing Support</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Continuous compliance monitoring and updates.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-file-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Documentation &amp; Reporting</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">DoP preparation and technical documentation assistance.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-sync-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Remediation Support</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Correction of non-conformities and compliance gaps.</p></div></div></div></section